  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">天際城市</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>天際城市是為玩家探索與享受而創建的地圖。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>這裡有摩天大樓、過山車和大型火車站等特色景點。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>每個建築都獨一無二且裝飾精美，允許多名玩家在不受空間限制的情況下共同遊玩。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>您將體驗到功能各異的建築數小時的娛樂樂趣。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>如果您喜歡我的作品，可以透過我的 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Patreon 帳號</strong></span> 支持我：<a href=\"patreon.com/Minecreator_666\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">patreon.com/Minecreator_666</a></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>地圖</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>您可以在下方查看包含所有建築的地圖。一切都具有功能性並經過精心裝飾。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4e7d290b-cdc5-428d-b4e4-d3a197873610.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b95425a5-87fc-4745-8846-754abfa5d6ee.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_14dec404-63b9-44b2-b88d-88164753ac1c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1d192df4-4274-4781-853f-1c34b170deaf.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e2cdb445-e979-4068-ad00-2b801e1f53f3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9a1f86a7-98e5-4694-83f4-53b6996fd9b8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a0563606-6803-4d6b-a3a7-5a9c2b76053e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_21c8dc31-029d-4b48-8561-535eb7cf185d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">更新</span></em></span></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>隨著時間推移，將會有更新內容，帶來巨型結構和功能改進。</span></p>",
